  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Reason for Refusal\r\n\r\nThe existing outbuilding, by means of its positioning, size, scale, design and appearance, is visually incongruous with respect to the Ruskin Avenue street scene and results in a loss of light to adjoining properties.  It also reduces the private amenity area of the subject property to an unacceptable level, which is harmful to the associated occupants' living conditions and is therefore contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development) and H.6.3 (Backland Development) of The London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan, Adopted December 2003; and the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines.\r\n"
